event: thinking
data: {"id": "9fee4a6a09a84bcb-thinking-layer-244", "run_id": "9fee4a6a09a84bcb", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据 `kubectl get` 输出，该 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，这通常意味着正在创建容器沙箱或拉取镜像，但尚未进入运行状态。鉴于 `READY 0/1` 且处于非 `Running` 状态，它被归类为异常。\n\n为了进一步确认具体原因（如镜像拉取失败、卷挂载失败等），我需要获取 Runbook 进行诊断指导。根据 `ContainerCreating` 状态，最相关的可能是 `pod-imagepull-failed.md` 或 `pod-sandbox-create-failed.md`。\n\n首先，我将获取 `pod-imagepull-failed.md` 以检查是否存在镜像拉取相关的问题。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789059588123}

