data: {"id": "9fee4a6a09a84bcb-thinking-parallel_evidence-4089", "run_id": "9fee4a6a09a84bcb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在证据已经足够清晰了。根据 kubectl_describe 和预采集的 Metrics/Topology 结果，我已获得完整的诊断证据链。\n\n---\n\n## 实体\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh`\n- **Pod UID**: `546ed0f3-c379-4bda-a2fe-3ffbf1b916a2`\n- **节点**: `node2` (`10.2.0.50`)\n- **容器**: `app` (镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)\n- **所属控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-5dbb5dcd6c` → Deployment `workload`\n\n---\n\n## 已确认事实与因果链\n\n### 1. Pod 当前状态确认为 ContainerCreating（未恢复）\n\n**Metrics 证据**:\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{...reason", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789059671389, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

