data: {"id": "9fee4a6a09a84bcb-final", "run_id": "9fee4a6a09a84bcb", "seq": 4094, "ts_ms": 1789059690075, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh (aiops-case-05) 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态，无法完成网络初始化。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubelet` (fact-3247bf2f14eb) | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: Failed to create pod sandbox... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found | 确认 Pod 启动时的底层阻断原因，直接指向缺失的 CNI 网络定义。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `multus` (fact-065a44ef2491) | `NoNetworkFound`: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found | 确认 Multus 插件在解析 Pod 网络请求时的具体失败信息。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | `kubelet` (fact-021b23868b48) | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: Failed to create pod sandbox... failed setup network for sandbox \"1c732291ae159cc396441fe6bf611159112dfd21478aa8f8c53ac5746776660a\" | 记录网络插件失败导致的 Sandbox 创建失败案例。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` (fact-902dbec45cf6) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (Reason: `ContainerCreating`) | 验证 Pod 当前持续卡在等待状态，与事件中的网络初始化失败现象一致。 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n事件维度（#1, #2）提供了决定性证据，明确指出 Multus 插件在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络定义，导致 Sandbox 创建失败。指标数据（#4）确认了容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态，这与网络初始化卡死的现象完全吻合。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPod 配置引用了不存在的 Multus 网络 'unavailable-network' → Multus 插件在命名空间 aiops-case-05 中查找失败 → kubelet 创建 Pod Sandbox 的网络插件调用报错 → Pod 持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因为：Pod 配置引用了一个在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在的 Multus NetworkAttachmentDefinition（名为 `unavailable-network`）。这导致 Multus CNI 插件无法完成网络插件加载，进而使 kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox。证据（#1, #2）均明确指出了具体的缺失资源名称和命名空间，因果关系清晰。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 51.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 45.5s (Evidence 37.4s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 107.868, "metrics": {"run_id": "9fee4a6a09a84bcb", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 107.87532329559326, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 107875.32329559326, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 96803.90810966492, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 23679.911136627197, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 10733.004093170166}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 51818.57228279114, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 45540.70258140564, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10495.23901939392, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

